  "releaseNotes": "1.0.x - Production release.\n1.1.x - Improved support for nested property elements.\n1.2.x - Improved Xliff 2.0 Support.\n1.3.x - Pull translations from target languages.\n2.0.x - Update of Namespace / Inclusion of version auditing.\n2.1.x - Simplified Vorto Configuration, Improved translation status dialogs, Health Checks.\n2.2.x - Improved Inline Image/Macro and Link Xliff formatting.\n8.0.x - Umbraco 8 Version.\n8.1.x - Umbraco 8.1 Compatable version (Still works on 8.0).\n8.2.x - Culture LCID -> Name Migration (Improved Language Support).\n8.3.x - Simpler custom mapping config.\n8.4.x - Support for v8.7 Block List Editor.\n8.5.x - Batch translation dashboard, history logging.\n8.6.x - Missing content target checking.\n8.7.x - RegEx Properties and Blob support\n9.0.x - Mulit-targeted Umbraco v8/v9 Release\n10.x - Umbraco 10 release\n11.x - Umbraco 11 release\n12.x - Umbraco 12 release\n13.x - Umbraco 13 release\n14.x - Umbraco 14 release",
